  unitName: Gun Lady Serin
  unitId: 820004
  unitNumber: 8004
  description: Usually the most calm and collected of the Battle Maidens, even she
    couldn't contain herself as she watched her allies collapse under the overwhelming
    powers of the gods. Suffering her first defeat, she isolated herself just outside
    of the Sama Kingdom, but thoughts of the broken squadron lingered on her mind.
    She vowed to become stronger so she could have her revenge.
  summonDesc: Show me the way to power,<br>and I blaze you a path to victory.<br>Deal?
  fusionDesc: Ooh, something's tingling.<br>Is this the feeling of power?<br>I could
    get addicted.
  evoDesc: Gaining power is a prerequisite.<br>I've got all I want,<br>but why do
    I feel something's missing?
